## Model card

- **Name:** MiMo V2.5 Free
- **Short description:** Native omni-modal open-weights MoE by Xiaomi for text, image, video and audio understanding plus strong agentic coding. Free capped tier on Zen.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen `opencode/mimo-v2.5-free` — see meta.json
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026 per vendor docs; knowledge cutoff 2026-03
- **IDs:** `opencode/mimo-v2.5-free`
- **Context window:** 200K Zen cap (native 1M) / 32K out
- **Modalities:** Text, image, audio, video in; text out
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-23):** Free Zen tier $0/$0 (200K Zen cap, native 1M $0.14/$0.28) — note: Free Zen tier; native from ~$0.14/$0.28 per 1M
- **Architecture:** Proprietary

