### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 78/100.** Evidence TB2.1 63.7% 75th pct ; Hard 41.7% 91st ; Tau2 90.6%; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 75/100.** Evidence Index 38 ; GPQA 81.6 ; HLE 27.2; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 70/100.** 200K Zen cap (native 1M) / 32K out — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 95/100.** Text, image, audio, video in; text out; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 78/100.** Evidence SWE 71% ; SWE-Pro 56.1 ; TB2.0 65.8; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 100/100.** Free Zen tier $0/$0 (200K Zen cap, native 1M $0.14/$0.28).
- **Overall Score: 79/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (78+75+70+95+78)/5=79.2 → 79; best-fit per scoring methodology.

